{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following PyPy 3 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original PyPy 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport sys\n\ndef input():\n    return sys.stdin.readline().rstrip()\n\ndef inp():\n    return int(input())\n\ndef inpl():\n    return list(map(int, input().split()))\n\nn, mod = inpl()\n\nm = n*(n-1)//2\n\n# dp[i][j][k] = number of ways\ndp = [[[0]*(n+1) for _ in range(m+1)] for _ in range(n+1)]\ndp[1][0][1] = 1\n\nfor i in range(1, n):\n    for j in range(m+1):\n        for k in range(n+1):\n            cur = dp[i][j][k]\n            if cur == 0:\n                continue\n            # Insert at position i (adds i inversions)\n            dp[i+1][j+i][i+1] = (dp[i+1][j+i][i+1] + cur) % mod\n            # Insert at positions 0 to i-1\n            for l in range(i):\n                new_j = j + i - 1 - l\n                dp[i+1][new_j][k] = (dp[i+1][new_j][k] + cur) % mod\n\n# Prefix over j\nS_dp = [[[0]*(m+1) for _ in range(n+1)] for _ in range(n+1)]\nfor i in range(n+1):\n    for k in range(n+1):\n        cum = 0\n        for j in range(m+1):\n            cum = (cum + dp[i][j][k]) % mod\n            S_dp[i][k][j] = cum\n\n# Prefix over k\nSS_dp = [[[0]*(n+1) for _ in range(m+1)] for _ in range(n+1)]\nfor i in range(n+1):\n    for j in range(m+1):\n        cum = 0\n        for k in range(n+1):\n            cum = (cum + S_dp[i][k][j]) % mod\n            SS_dp[i][j][k] = cum\n\nANS = [0]*(n+1)\nfor i in range(1, n+1):\n    total = i * ANS[i-1] % mod\n    for k in range(n+1):\n        for j in range(1, m+1):\n            if dp[i][j][k] == 0:\n                continue\n            diff = (SS_dp[i][j-1][-1] - SS_dp[i][j-1][k]) % mod\n            total = (total + dp[i][j][k] * diff) % mod\n    ANS[i] = total\n\nprint(ANS[-1] % mod)\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <algorithm>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    ios_base::sync_with_stdio(false);\n    cin.tie(nullptr);\n\n    int n, mod;\n    cin >> n >> mod;\n\n    int m = n * (n - 1) / 2;\n\n    // dp[i][j][k] = number of ways\n    vector<vector<vector<long long>>> dp(n + 1, \n        vector<vector<long long>>(m + 1, \n        vector<long long>(n + 1, 0)));\n    dp[1][0][1] = 1;\n\n    for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {\n        for (int j = 0; j <= m; j++) {\n            for (int k = 0; k <= n; k++) {\n                long long cur = dp[i][j][k];\n                if (cur == 0) continue;\n                // Insert at position i (adds i inversions)\n                dp[i+1][j+i][i+1] = (dp[i+1][j+i][i+1] + cur) % mod;\n                // Insert at positions 0 to i-1\n                for (int l = 0; l < i; l++) {\n                    int new_j = j + i - 1 - l;\n                    dp[i+1][new_j][k] = (dp[i+1][new_j][k] + cur) % mod;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Prefix over j: S_dp[i][k][j] = sum_{j'=0}^{j} dp[i][j'][k]\n    vector<vector<vector<long long>>> S_dp(n + 1,\n        vector<vector<long long>>(n + 1,\n        vector<long long>(m + 1, 0)));\n    for (int i = 0; i <= n; i++) {\n        for (int k = 0; k <= n; k++) {\n            long long cum = 0;\n            for (int j = 0; j <= m; j++) {\n                cum = (cum + dp[i][j][k]) % mod;\n                S_dp[i][k][j] = cum;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Prefix over k: SS_dp[i][j][k] = sum_{k'=0}^{k} S_dp[i][k'][j]\n    vector<vector<vector<long long>>> SS_dp(n + 1,\n        vector<vector<long long>>(m + 1,\n        vector<long long>(n + 1, 0)));\n    for (int i = 0; i <= n; i++) {\n        for (int j = 0; j <= m; j++) {\n            long long cum = 0;\n            for (int k = 0; k <= n; k++) {\n                cum = (cum + S_dp[i][k][j]) % mod;\n                SS_dp[i][j][k] = cum;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    vector<long long> ANS(n + 1, 0);\n    for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n        long long total = i * ANS[i-1] % mod;\n        for (int k = 0; k <= n; k++) {\n            for (int j = 1; j <= m; j++) {\n                if (dp[i][j][k] == 0) continue;\n                long long diff = (SS_dp[i][j-1][n] - SS_dp[i][j-1][k]) % mod;\n                if (diff < 0) diff += mod;\n                total = (total + dp[i][j][k] * diff) % mod;\n            }\n        }\n        ANS[i] = total;\n    }\n\n    cout << ANS[n] % mod << endl;\n\n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00010239553375868127, -2.145764938177308e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, -1.156323378381785e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.0003071551618631929, -1.9073468138230965e-06, -1.9073304429184645e-05, -3.576278118089249e-07, -8.916457591112703e-05, -1.490105023549404e-05, -0.1426856368780136, -5.8412379075889476e-06, -0.04004116356372833, -0.029751459136605263, -0.05490272864699364, -1.0490362910786644e-05, -2.861018856492592e-06, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -0.028803188353776932, -0.00017128908075392246, -7.390948667307384e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -8.344646857949556e-07, -0.004716106224805117, -0.00018261195509694517, -3.576278118089249e-07, -8.940656698541